    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"letting go of the need to keep going\"? it feels like if i stop, i just lose everything. the debt doesnt go away, the landlord doesnt care, and i just end up on the street. i feel like there's no version of this where it actually gets better, it just feels like a slow death.",
